{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51258","headline":"爲哥舒翰歌 · 西鄙人","name":"爲哥舒翰歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（天宝中，哥舒翰爲安西节度使，控地数千里，甚着威令。\n故西鄙人歌曰：）北斗七星高，哥舒夜带刀。\n吐蕃总杀尽，更筑[丽]（西）重壕。\n（《全唐诗》後二句作「至今窥牧马，不敢过临洮」。\n《南部新书》庚）（据《太平广记》卷四九五引《乾𦠆子》及《知不足斋丛书》本《南部新书》校改\n「哥舒」，《太平广记》作「歌舒翰」，衍一字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"西鄙人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}